    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore the vast ocean, survive deadly encounters, and uncover the secrets of a lost island.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adrift in Silence</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is calm. The sky burns orange. You\u2019re alone\u2014until the storm crashes down, and the nightmare begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Something Beneath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/b0db1212a57979b82c67c77a45f17657.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/b0db1212a57979b82c67c77a45f17657.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/b0db1212a57979b82c67c77a45f17657.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadow moves below the waves. Help arrives... and vanishes in an instant. You're not alone out here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Island Wasn't Meant to Be Found</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/cc84e2266b099a48ff862dffb7f53fe8.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/cc84e2266b099a48ff862dffb7f53fe8.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/cc84e2266b099a48ff862dffb7f53fe8.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged from the sea to a forgotten land, you wake in a place where nature never moved on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run, Hide, Survive</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4f3449665bf14d95a75d74c58adba1a4.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4f3449665bf14d95a75d74c58adba1a4.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4f3449665bf14d95a75d74c58adba1a4.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dense jungles to abandoned labs, you'll search for a way out. But when night falls, it's not just survival-it's escape... or extinction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Past. Challenge the Future</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the dark experiments that doomed this land. Encounter ancient creatures brought back to life by science and greed. Your choices will determine who lives\u2014and who becomes part of extinction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story-driven adventure where every moment is packed with tension and spectacle. From being stranded at sea to battling prehistoric predators, players are taken on a linear yet immersive journey across ocean and island environments. Explore a mysterious sci-fi lab, witness dramatic dinosaur encounters, and make it through high-stakes sequences with limited combat and intense pacing. Your goal: uncover the truth and escape alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic story-driven survival</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic dinosaur and sea creature encounters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world island exploration</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi lab discovery and secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense \u201csurvive the night\u201d gameplay</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Explore the vast ocean, survive deadly encounters, and uncover the secrets of a lost island.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adrift in Silence</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/24915e2c83f96b1a482633a80741aaf0.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is calm. The sky burns orange. You\u2019re alone\u2014until the storm crashes down, and the nightmare begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Something Beneath</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/b0db1212a57979b82c67c77a45f17657.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/b0db1212a57979b82c67c77a45f17657.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/b0db1212a57979b82c67c77a45f17657.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadow moves below the waves. Help arrives... and vanishes in an instant. You're not alone out here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Island Wasn't Meant to Be Found</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/cc84e2266b099a48ff862dffb7f53fe8.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/cc84e2266b099a48ff862dffb7f53fe8.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/cc84e2266b099a48ff862dffb7f53fe8.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragged from the sea to a forgotten land, you wake in a place where nature never moved on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run, Hide, Survive</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4f3449665bf14d95a75d74c58adba1a4.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4f3449665bf14d95a75d74c58adba1a4.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/4f3449665bf14d95a75d74c58adba1a4.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dense jungles to abandoned labs, you'll search for a way out. But when night falls, it's not just survival-it's escape... or extinction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Past. Challenge the Future</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.poster.avif?t=1755688273\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.webm?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736540/extras/c0d3c44f0ae48b6306e9820ff86a8b49.mp4?t=1755688273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the dark experiments that doomed this land. Encounter ancient creatures brought back to life by science and greed. Your choices will determine who lives\u2014and who becomes part of extinction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story-driven adventure where every moment is packed with tension and spectacle. From being stranded at sea to battling prehistoric predators, players are taken on a linear yet immersive journey across ocean and island environments. Explore a mysterious sci-fi lab, witness dramatic dinosaur encounters, and make it through high-stakes sequences with limited combat and intense pacing. Your goal: uncover the truth and escape alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic story-driven survival</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic dinosaur and sea creature encounters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world island exploration</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi lab discovery and secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense \u201csurvive the night\u201d gameplay</p></li></ul>",
